  m_text: "<b>Eye + Hand interaction</b>\nLook at a cube to highlight it.\nGrab it
    with the hand ray (point and pinch) or reach out and grab it directly.\n\n<b>Eye
    tracking is OFF in this template.</b> Without it, your head direction is used
    instead of your eyes.\nTo use eye tracking in this scene:\n1. Tools > Android
    XR > Enable Eye Tracking\n   (or Project Settings > XR Plug-in Management > OpenXR
    > Android tab > Eye Gaze Interaction Profile)\n2. Rebuild the app. It asks for
    eye tracking permission at startup.\n\nNote: MRTK3 look-and-pinch (gaze pinch)
    does not work on Android XR devices yet."
